>け</span><span begin="58.163" end="58.394">ら</span><span begin="58.394" end="58.600">れ</span><span begin="58.600" end="58.944">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只不过是对熟人B露出的</span></p><p begin="59.237" end="1:06.203" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.237" end="59.477">笑</span><span begin="59.477" end="59.899">顔</span><span begin="59.899" end="1:00.112">が</span><span begin="1:00.112" end="1:00.328">あ</span><span begin="1:00.328" end="1:00.541">れ</span><span begin="1:00.541" end="1:00.771">な</span><span begin="1:00.771" end="1:00.985">ら</span><span begin="1:00.985" end="1:01.206">も</span><span begin="1:01.206" end="1:01.480">う</span> <span begin="1:01.635" end="1:02.085">恐</span><span begin="1:02.085" end="1:02.439">ろ</span><span begin="1:02.439" end="1:02.960">し</span><span begin="1:02.960" end="1:03.338">い</span><span begin="1:03.338" end="1:03.817">人</span><span begin="1:03.817" end="1:06.203">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果那就是你的笑容 那你真是个可怕的人啊</span></p><p begin="1:07.074" end="1:13.086" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.074" end="1:07.509">君</span><span begin="1:07.509" end="1:07.951">を</span><span begin="1:07.951" end="1:08.169">惚</span><span begin="1:08.169" end="1:08.512">れ</span><span begin="1:08.512" end="1:08.724">さ</span><span begin="1:08.724" end="1:09.036">せ</span><span begin="1:09.036" end="1:09.639">る</span> <span begin="1:09.905" end="1:10.321">黒</span><span begin="1:10.321" end="1:10.709">魔</span><span begin="1:10.709" end="1:10.984">術</span><span begin="1:10.984" end="1:11.356">は</span><span begin="1:11.356" end="1:11.640">知</span><span begin="1:11.640" end="1:12.051">ら</span><span begin="1:12.051" end="1:12.298">な</span><span begin="1:12.298" end="1:12.446">い</span><span begin="1:12.446" end="1:13.086">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不知道能让你爱上我的黑魔法</span></p><p begin="1:14.027" end="1:17.441" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.027" end="1:14.481">海</span><span begin="1:14.481" end="1:14.616">に</span><span begin="1:14.616" end="1:15.061">誘</span><span begin="1:15.061" end="1:15.274">う</span><span begin="1:15.274" end="1:15.653">勇</span><span begin="1:15.653" end="1:15.969">気</span><span begin="1:15.969" end="1:16.151">も</span><span begin="1:16.151" end="1:16.860">車</span><span begin="1:16.860" end="1:16.959">も</span><span begin="1:16.959" end="1:17.296">な</span><span begin="1:17.296" end="1:17.441">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也没有约你去海边的勇气和车</span></p><p begin="1:17.505" end="1:21.395" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.505" end="1:17.658">で</span><span begin="1:17.658" end="1:18.379">も</span><span begin="1:18.379" end="1:18.603">見</span><span begin="1:18.603" end="1:18.735">た</span><span begin="1:18.735" end="1:18.854">い</span><span begin="1:19.037" end="1:19.242">と</span><span begin="1:19.242" end="1:19.464">な</span><span begin="1:19.464" end="1:19.890">り</span><span begin="1:19.890" end="1:20.077">で</span><span begin="1:20.077" end="1:20.261">目</span><span begin="1:20.261" end="1:20.722">覚</span><span begin="1:20.722" end="1:20.971">め</span><span begin="1:20.971" end="1:21.395">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但是我想看见 在你身边醒来</span></p><p begin="1:21.644" end="1:24.056" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.644" end="1:21.864">お</span><span begin="1:21.864" end="1:22.078">は</span><span begin="1:22.078" end="1:22.294">よ</span><span begin="1:22.294" end="1:22.479">う</span><span begin="1:22.479" end="1:22.711">と</span><span begin="1:22.711" end="1:23.140">笑</span><span begin="1:23.140" end="1:23.349">う</span><span begin="1:23.349" end="1:23.821">君</span><span begin="1:23.821" end="1:24.056">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">笑着对我说早上好的你</span></p><p begin="1:24.251" end="1:28.381" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.251" end="1:24.495">会</span><span begin="1:24.495" end="1:24.687">い</span><span begin="1:24.687" end="1:24.913">た</span><span begin="1:24.913" end="1:25.137">い</span><span begin="1:25.137" end="1:25.337">ん</span><span begin="1:25.337" end="1:25.618">だ</span> <span begin="1:25.618" end="1:25.869">今</span><span begin="1:25.869" end="1:26.200">す</span><span begin="1:26.200" end="1:26.340">ぐ</span><span begin="1:26.340" end="1:26.636">そ</span><span begin="1:26.636" end="1:27.052">の</span><span begin="1:27.052" end="1:27.720">角</span><span begin="1:27.720" end="1:28.141">か</span><span begin="1:28.141" end="1:28.381">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好想见到你啊 就现在 从那个街角</span></p><p begin="1:28.607" end="1:31.894" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.607" end="1:28.814">飛</span><span begin="1:28.814" end="1:29.040">び</span><span begin="1:29.040" end="1:29.186">出</span><span begin="1:29.186" end="1:29.444">し</span><span begin="1:29.444" end="1:29.683">て</span><span begin="1:29.683" end="1:29.894">き</span><span begin="1:29.894" end="1:30.107">て</span><span begin="1:30.107" end="1:30.538">く</span><span begin="1:30.538" end="1:30.752">れ</span><span begin="1:30.752" end="1:31.312">な</span><span begin="1:31.312" end="1:31.618">い</span><span begin="1:31.618" end="1:31.894">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你能不能突然跑出来呢</span></p><p begin="1:32.060" end="1:37.720" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.060" end="1:32.477">夏</span><span begin="1:32.477" end="1:32.636">の</span><span begin="1:32.636" end="1:32.942">魔</span><span begin="1:32.942" end="1:33.365">物</span><span begin="1:33.365" end="1:33.555">に</span><span begin="1:33.555" end="1:34.031">連</span><span begin="1:34.031" end="1:34.144">れ</span><span begin="1:34.144" end="1:34.700">去</span><span begin="1:34.700" end="1:35.109">ら</span><span begin="1:35.109" end="1:35.490">れ</span> <span begin="1:35.755" end="1:36.181">僕</span><span begin="1:36.181" end="1:36.399">の</span><span begin="1:36.399" end="1:36.628">も</span><span begin="1:36.628" end="1:36.846">と</span><span begin="1:36.846" end="1:37.720">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被夏日的魔物带走 来到我的身边</span></p><p begin="1:38.174" end="1:41.852" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.174" end="1:38.375">生</span><span begin="1:38.375" end="1:38.601">ま</span><span begin="1:38.601" end="1:38.805">れ</span><span begin="1:38.805" end="1:39.042">た</span><span begin="1:39.042" end="1:39.476">星</span><span begin="1:39.476" end="1:39.688">の</span><span begin="1:39.688" end="1:39.897">も</span><span begin="1:39.897" end="1:40.101">と</span><span begin="1:40.101" end="1:40.295">が</span> <span begin="1:40.295" end="1:40.962">違</span><span begin="1:40.962" end="1:41.186">く</span><span begin="1:41.186" end="1:41.496">た</span><span begin="1:41.496" end="1:41.629">っ</span><span begin="1:41.629" end="1:41.852">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使我们生来命运不同</span></p><p begin="1:42.065" end="1:46.584" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.065" end="1:42.434">偶</span><span begin="1:42.434" end="1:42.914">然</span><span begin="1:42.914" end="1:43.155">と</span><span begin="1:43.155" end="1:43.586">夏</span><span begin="1:43.586" end="1:43.804">の</span><span begin="1:43.804" end="1:44.035">魔</span><span begin="1:44.035" end="1:44.457">法</span><span begin="1:44.457" end="1:44.623">と</span><span begin="1:44.623" end="1:44.909">や</span><span begin="1:44.909" end="1:45.104">ら</span><span begin="1:45.104" end="1:45.280">の</span><span begin="1:45.280" end="1:46.403">力</span><span begin="1:46.403" end="1:46.584">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也借着偶然和所谓夏日魔法的力量</span></p><p begin="1:46.846" end="1:55.966" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.846" end="1:47.854">僕</span><span begin="1:47.854" end="1:48.161">の</span><span begin="1:48.161" end="1:48.607">も</span><span begin="1:48.607" end="1:49.030">の</span><span begin="1:49.030" end="1:50.326">に</span> <span begin="1:50.761" end="1:51.011">な</span><span begin="1:51.011" end="1:51.410">る</span><span begin="1:51.410" end="1:51.599">わ</span><span begin="1:51.599" end="1:51.827">け</span><span begin="1:51.827" end="1:52.041">な</span><span begin="1:52.041" end="1:52.269">い</span><span begin="1:52.269" end="1:55.966">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道就不能成为我的人吗</span></p><p begin="2:07.680" end="2:12.172" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.680" end="2:08.142">君</span><span begin="2:08.142" end="2:08.335">の</span><span begin="2:08.335" end="2:09.008">恋</span><span begin="2:09.008" end="2:09.669">人</span><span begin="2:09.669" end="2:09.893">に</span><span begin="2:09.893" end="2:10.153">な</span><span begin="2:10.153" end="2:10.361">る</span><span begin="2:11.116" end="2:11.633">人</span><span begin="2:11.633" end="2:12.172">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">能成为你恋人的那个人</span></p><p begin="2:13.154" end="2:18.247" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.154" end="2:13.375">モ</span><span begin="2:13.375" end="2:13.575">デ</span><span begin="2:13.575" end="2:14.026">ル</span><span begin="2:14.026" end="2:14.207">み</span><span begin="2:14.207" end="2:14.461">た</span><span begin="2:14.461" end="2:14.684">い</span><span begin="2:14.684" end="2:15.066">な</span><span begin="2:15.066" end="2:15.962">人</span><span begin="2:15.962" end="2:16.194">な</span><span begin="2:16.194" end="2:16.358">ん</span><span begin="2:16.358" end="2:16.622">だ</span><span begin="2:16.622" end="2:16.845">ろ</span><span begin="2:16.845" end="2:18.247">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一定是像模特一样的人吧</span></p><p begin="2:21.488" end="2:25.856" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.488" end="2:21.836">そ</span><span begin="2:21.836" end="2:22.024">い</span><span begin="2:22.024" end="2:22.248">つ</span><span begin="2:22.248" end="2:22.599">は</span><span begin="2:22.599" end="2:22.830">き</span><span begin="2:22.830" end="2:22.948">っ</span><span begin="2:22.948" end="2:23.334">と</span> <span begin="2:23.334" end="2:23.811">君</span><span begin="2:23.811" end="2:24.255">よ</span><span begin="2:24.255" end="2:24.454">り</span><span begin="2:24.454" end="2:24.633">も</span><span begin="2:24.633" end="2:25.116">年</span><span begin="2:25.116" end="2:25.521">上</span><span begin="2:25.521" end="2:25.856">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那家伙一定比你年长</span></p><p begin="2:26.160" end="2:32.769" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.160" end="2:26.383">焼</span><span begin="2:26.383" end="2:26.621">け</span><span begin="2:26.621" end="2:26.828">た</span><span begin="2:26.828" end="2:27.272">肌</span><span begin="2:27.272" end="2:27.494">が</span><span begin="2:27.494" end="2:27.830">よ</span><span begin="2:27.830" end="2:27.933">く</span><span begin="2:27.933" end="2:28.156">似</span><span begin="2:28.156" end="2:28.292">合</span><span begin="2:28.292" end="2:28.424">う</span> <span begin="2:28.588" end="2:29.028">洋</span><span begin="2:29.028" end="2:29.331">楽</span><span begin="2:29.331" end="2:29.683">好</span><span begin="2:29.683" end="2:29.943">き</span><span begin="2:29.943" end="2:30.296">な</span><span begin="2:30.296" end="2:30.744">人</span><span begin="2:30.744" end="2:32.769">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">很适合晒黑的皮肤 而且是个喜欢西洋音乐的人</span></p><p begin="2:33.950" end="2:40.034" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.950" end="2:34.122">キ</span><span begin="2:34.122" end="2:34.448">ス</span><span begin="2:34.448" end="2:34.787">を</span><span begin="2:34.787" end="2:35.083">す</span><span begin="2:35.083" end="2:35.507">る</span><span begin="2:35.507" end="2:35.724">と</span><span begin="2:35.724" end="2:35.971">き</span><span begin="2:35.971" end="2:36.614">も</span> <span begin="2:36.833" end="2:37.275">君</span><span begin="2:37.275" end="2:37.472">は</span><span begin="2:37.472" end="2:37.716">背</span><span begin="2:37.716" end="2:37.895">伸</span><span begin="2:37.895" end="2:38.274">び</span><span begin="2:38.274" end="2:38.584">し</span><span begin="2:38.584" end="2:39.028">て</span><span begin="2:39.028" end="2:39.464">い</span><span begin="2:39.464" end="2:40.034">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就连接吻的时候 你也要踮起脚尖</span></p><p begin="2:40.966" end="2:44.450" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.966" end="2:41.666">頭</span><span begin="2:41.666" end="2:41.827">を</span><span begin="2:41.827" end="2:42.062">な</span><span begin="2:42.062" end="2:42.305">で</span><span begin="2:42.305" end="2:42.520">ら</span><span begin="2:42.520" end="2:42.686">れ</span><span begin="2:42.686" end="2:43.118">君</span><span begin="2:43.118" end="2:43.383">が</span><span begin="2:43.383" end="2:43.738">笑</span><span begin="2:43.738" end="2:44.054">い</span><span begin="2:44.054" end="2:44.301">ま</span><span begin="2:44.301" end="2:44.450">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他摸着你的头 而你露出了笑容</span></p><p begin="2:44.460" end="2:48.320" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.460" end="2:44.700">駄</span><span begin="2:44.700" end="2:45.110">目</span><span begin="2:45.110" end="2:45.314">だ</span><span begin="2:45.314" end="2:45.908">何</span><span begin="2:45.908" end="2:46.388">ひ</span><span begin="2:46.388" end="2:46.717">と</span><span begin="2:46.717" end="2:46.826">つ</span><span begin="2:46.826" end="2:47.248">勝</span><span begin="2:47.248" end="2:47.280">っ</span><span begin="2:47.280" end="2:47.702">て</span><span begin="2:47.702" end="2:47.926">な</span><span begin="2:47.926" end="2:48.320">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不行啊 我根本一点都赢不了他</span></p><p begin="2:48.586" end="2:51.138" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.586" end="2:48.727">い</span><span begin="2:48.727" end="2:49.025">や</span><span begin="2:49.025" end="2:49.228">待</span><span begin="2:49.228" end="2:49.439">て</span><span begin="2:49.439" end="2:49.605">よ</span> <span begin="2:49.605" end="2:49.892">そ</span><sp