"3:46.165" end="3:46.383">き</span><span begin="3:46.383" end="3:46.637">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">冲昏了头脑——脑海里浮现的尽是这种可怕的结局</span></p><p begin="3:46.830" end="3:50.946" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:46.830" end="3:47.056">真</span><span begin="3:47.056" end="3:47.488">夏</span><span begin="3:47.488" end="3:47.655">の</span><span begin="3:47.655" end="3:48.150">空</span><span begin="3:48.150" end="3:48.343">の</span><span begin="3:48.343" end="3:48.784">下</span><span begin="3:48.784" end="3:49.001">で</span><span begin="3:49.001" end="3:49.668">震</span><span begin="3:49.668" end="3:49.862">え</span><span begin="3:49.862" end="3:50.277">な</span><span begin="3:50.277" end="3:50.741">が</span><span begin="3:50.741" end="3:50.946">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在盛夏的天空下 一边颤抖着</span></p><p begin="3:51.179" end="3:54.461" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:51.179" end="3:51.628">君</span><span begin="3:51.628" end="3:51.858">の</span><span begin="3:51.858" end="3:52.261">事</span><span begin="3:52.261" end="3:52.457">を</span><span begin="3:52.457" end="3:53.362">考</span><span begin="3:53.362" end="3:53.795">え</span><span begin="3:53.795" end="3:54.238">ま</span><span begin="3:54.238" end="3:54.461">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一边想着你的事情</span></p><p begin="3:54.616" end="4:00.296" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.616" end="3:54.863">好</span><span begin="3:54.863" end="3:55.078">き</span><span begin="3:55.078" end="3:55.306">な</span><span begin="3:55.306" end="3:55.518">ア</span><span begin="3:55.518" end="3:55.677">イ</span><span begin="3:55.677" end="3:55.906">ス</span><span begin="3:55.906" end="3:56.164">の</span><span begin="3:56.164" end="3:56.820">味</span><span begin="3:56.820" end="3:57.264">は</span><span begin="3:57.264" end="3:57.511">き</span><span begin="3:57.511" end="3:57.725">っ</span><span begin="3:57.725" end="4:00.296">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你喜欢的冰淇淋口味一定是……</span></p><p begin="4:00.741" end="4:05.001" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:00.741" end="4:00.952">会</span><span begin="4:00.952" end="4:01.141">い</span><span begin="4:01.141" end="4:01.392">た</span><span begin="4:01.392" end="4:01.633">い</span><span begin="4:01.633" end="4:01.833">ん</span><span begin="4:01.833" end="4:02.052">だ</span> <span begin="4:02.052" end="4:02.425">今</span><span begin="4:02.425" end="4:02.692">す</span><span begin="4:02.692" end="4:02.881">ぐ</span><span begin="4:02.881" end="4:03.144">そ</span><span begin="4:03.144" end="4:03.564">の</span><span begin="4:03.564" end="4:04.208">角</span><span begin="4:04.208" end="4:04.683">か</span><span begin="4:04.683" end="4:05.001">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好想见到你啊 就现在 从那个街角</span></p><p begin="4:05.085" end="4:08.365" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:05.085" end="4:05.303">飛</span><span begin="4:05.303" end="4:05.527">び</span><span begin="4:05.527" end="4:05.719">出</span><span begin="4:05.719" end="4:05.946">し</span><span begin="4:05.946" end="4:06.161">て</span><span begin="4:06.161" end="4:06.386">き</span><span begin="4:06.386" end="4:06.603">て</span><span begin="4:06.603" end="4:07.047">く</span><span begin="4:07.047" end="4:07.261">れ</span><span begin="4:07.261" end="4:07.774">な</span><span begin="4:07.774" end="4:08.117">い</span><span begin="4:08.117" end="4:08.365">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你能不能突然跑出来呢</span></p><p begin="4:08.592" end="4:14.400" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:08.592" end="4:09.001">夏</span><span begin="4:09.001" end="4:09.238">の</span><span begin="4:09.238" end="4:09.434">魔</span><span begin="4:09.434" end="4:09.887">物</span><span begin="4:09.887" end="4:10.051">に</span><span begin="4:10.051" end="4:10.520">連</span><span begin="4:10.520" end="4:10.679">れ</span><span begin="4:10.679" end="4:11.179">去</span><span begin="4:11.179" end="4:11.610">ら</span><span begin="4:11.610" end="4:12.026">れ</span> <span begin="4:12.261" end="4:12.685">僕</span><span begin="4:12.685" end="4:12.919">の</span><span begin="4:12.919" end="4:13.106">も</span><span begin="4:13.106" end="4:13.367">と</span><span begin="4:13.367" end="4:14.400">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被夏日的魔物带走 来到我的身边</span></p><p begin="4:14.665" end="4:18.356" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:14.665" end="4:14.885">生</span><span begin="4:14.885" end="4:15.096">ま</span><span begin="4:15.096" end="4:15.290">れ</span><span begin="4:15.290" end="4:15.528">た</span><span begin="4:15.528" end="4:15.945">星</span><span begin="4:15.945" end="4:16.136">の</span><span begin="4:16.136" end="4:16.353">も</span><span begin="4:16.353" end="4:16.591">と</span><span begin="4:16.591" end="4:16.798">が</span><span begin="4:16.798" end="4:17.443">違</span><span begin="4:17.443" end="4:17.665">く</span><span begin="4:17.665" end="4:18.024">た</span><span begin="4:18.024" end="4:18.129">っ</span><span begin="4:18.129" end="4:18.356">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使我们生来命运不同</span></p><p begin="4:18.580" end="4:23.126" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:18.580" end="4:18.922">偶</span><span begin="4:18.922" end="4:19.446">然</span><span begin="4:19.446" end="4:19.660">と</span><span begin="4:19.660" end="4:20.059">夏</span><span begin="4:20.059" end="4:20.293">の</span><span begin="4:20.293" end="4:20.508">魔</span><span begin="4:20.508" end="4:20.949">法</span><span begin="4:20.949" end="4:21.164">と</span><span begin="4:21.164" end="4:21.393">や</span><span begin="4:21.393" end="4:21.614">ら</span><span begin="4:21.614" end="4:21.787">の</span><span begin="4:21.787" end="4:22.926">力</span><span begin="4:22.926" end="4:23.126">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也借着偶然和所谓夏日魔法的力量</span></p><p begin="4:23.344" end="4:32.699" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:23.344" end="4:24.441">僕</span><span begin="4:24.441" end="4:24.672">の</span><span begin="4:24.672" end="4:25.075">も</span><span begin="4:25.075" end="4:25.530">の</span><span begin="4:25.530" end="4:26.586">に</span><span begin="4:27.239" end="4:27.490">な</span><span begin="4:27.490" end="4:27.907">る</span><span begin="4:27.907" end="4:28.109">わ</span><span begin="4:28.109" end="4:28.358">け</span><span begin="4:28.358" end="4:28.573">な</span><span begin="4:28.573" end="4:28.779">い</span><span begin="4:28.779" end="4:32.699">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道就不能成为我的人吗</span></p></div></body></tt>